{
  "mn99:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 99 ",
  "mn99:0.2": "Subhasutta ",
  "mn99:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn99:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn99:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena subho māṇavo todeyyaputto sāvatthiyaṁ paṭivasati aññatarassa gahapatissa nivesane kenacideva karaṇīyena. ",
  "mn99:2.2": "Atha kho subho māṇavo todeyyaputto yassa gahapatissa nivesane paṭivasati taṁ gahapatiṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn99:2.3": "“sutaṁ metaṁ, gahapati: ",
  "mn99:2.4": "‘avivittā sāvatthī arahantehī’ti. ",
  "mn99:2.5": "Kaṁ nu khvajja samaṇaṁ vā brāhmaṇaṁ vā payirupāseyyāmā”ti? ",
  "mn99:2.6": "“Ayaṁ, bhante, bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn99:2.7": "Taṁ, bhante, bhagavantaṁ payirupāsassū”ti. ",
  "mn99:3.1": "Atha kho subho māṇavo todeyyaputto tassa gahapatissa paṭissutvā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "mn99:3.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho subho māṇavo todeyyaputto bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn99:4.1": "“brāhmaṇā, bho gotama, evamāhaṁsu: ",
  "mn99:4.2": "‘gahaṭṭho ārādhako hoti ñāyaṁ dhammaṁ kusalaṁ, na pabbajito ārādhako hoti ñāyaṁ dhammaṁ kusalan’ti. ",
  "mn99:4.3": "Idha bhavaṁ gotamo kimāhā”ti? ",
  "mn99:4.4": "“Vibhajjavādo kho ahamettha, māṇava